# synth_yosys.ys — Yosys open-source synthesis script for ising_sampler_v2
#
# Why: Vivado is unavailable on this host. Yosys (via yowasp-yosys) provides
# open-source synthesis that can at minimum verify RTL is synthesis-clean
# and report resource estimates. Targeting generic synth rather than a
# specific technology library because we need portability; nextpnr-ice40
# can optionally perform place-and-route for iCE40 after this step.
#
# Usage (from repo root):
#   yosys hardware/kv260/synth_yosys.ys
# or via yowasp-yosys Python API:
#   from yowasp_yosys import run_yosys
#   run_yosys(['-s', 'hardware/kv260/synth_yosys.ys'])
read_verilog hardware/kv260/ising_sampler_v2.v
synth -top ising_sampler_v2 -flatten
stat -top ising_sampler_v2
write_json hardware/kv260/ising_sampler_v2_synth.json
